'''Bacha XVIII''' (Bacha Zhovan Tihoran Janbor ish Zhifol; born # MONTH {{abbr|2365|1965 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]] who reigned as [[King of Qym]] from DAY MONTH {{abbr|2409|2001 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} to DAY MONTH {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. 

Bacha was born during the reign of his paternal grandfather [[Bacha XVI of Qym|Bacha XVI]]. His father acceded to the throne in {{abbr|2372|1970.5 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} when he was still {{abbr|6 years old|5 years old (Earth Age Equivalent)}}. He became [[wikipedia:heir apparent|heir apparent]] upon reaching the age of {{abbr|30|25 (Earth Age Equivalent)}} in {{abbr|2395|1990 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. Bacha was educated at [[Vardu Primary School]] and [[Timianu Secondary School]] in [[Zhol]]. After completing a [[wikipedia:mathematics|mathematics]] degree from the [[Royal University of Zhol]], he served in the [[Royal Air Force of Qym|Royal Air Force]] and the [[Royal Army of Qym|Royal Army]] from {{abbr|2393|1988 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} to {{abbr|2399|1993 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. He then had various appointments in the [[Government of Qym]] to familiarize him with government work and prepare him to rule. He married [[Queen Qümica of Qym|Qümica]] in {{abbr|2408|2000 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} and they had two sons, [[Mirmo ish Zhifol|Mirmo]] and [[Prince Vuqac of Qym|Vuqac]], and two daughters, [[Princess Tamasna of Qym|Tamasna]] and [[Princess Hyleva of Qym|Hyleva]]. 

In {{abbr|2409|2001 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, Bacha, then {{abbr|43|36 (Earth Age Equivalent)}} years old, became king after his father automatically abdicated upon turning {{abbr|75|62 (Earth Age Equivalent)}}. Significant events of his reign include the STUFF, and his eldest son [[Mirmo ish Zhifol|Mirmo]]'s abdication of his royal titles and privileges in {{abbr|2433|2021 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. 

