*[[Princess Tamasna of Qym|Princess Tamasna]] (born DAY MONTH {{abbr|2414|2005 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}; age {{abbr|26|22 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} as of {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}})
*[[Princess Hyleva of Qym|Princess Hyleva]] (born DAY MONTH {{abbr|2418|2009 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}; age {{abbr|22|18 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} as of {{abbr|2440|2027 (Earth Year Equivalent)}})

